# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zygote (32-bit secondary) requires a non-empty 32-bit ABI list.
# On Android 14+, init commonly derives ro.product.cpu.abilist* from
# ro.product.product.cpu.abilist*; ensure these are populated for zygote_secondary.
#
# NOTE:
# - ro.product.cpu.abilist* may be overwritten by init early in boot.
# - ro.product.product.cpu.abilist* are the ones init usually reads to derive ro.product.*.
# If this still does not stick, move these same lines to /system/build.prop or /product/build.prop
# (wherever your build defines ro.product.product.*).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
